description: When creating or updating page
alwaysApply: false
---

Structure
- layout.tsx       — AccessLayer + DrawerProvider (must be 'use client' if wrapping a client provider)
- page.tsx         — Server component: Client Component + Suspense fallback skeleton, use <SuspenseBoundry> Custom Component.
- <module>-page.tsx — Client component: PageContainer filters, data fetch, list render, top-level action button

layout.tsx
- Wrap with <AccessLayer permission="<module>" accessType="read">.
- Wrap with the module's DrawerProvider so all children share drawer context.
- Must be 'use client' when it imports a client provider.

page.tsx (server)
- Add New Item, view history, change log and similar actions go to PageContainer actions prop.
- Wrap client component in custom SuspenseBoundry component.

<module>-page.tsx (client)
- Use <PageContainer title subtitle icon actions breadcrumbs> from @/components/containers/page.
- useFilters<FiltersType>() for URL-persisted filter state.
- Top-level action button (e.g. "New Assessment") gated with <ProtectedButton permission accessType>.
- Renders filter bar + list component.
- Handles loading skeleton inline (isFetching check).

Access gating
- Page-level: AccessLayer in layout.tsx.
- Button-level: ProtectedButton with permission + accessType props.
- Conditional render of edit/add CTAs: check access['write_<module>'] from useUserModuleAccessContext().

Tests
- Pure helpers extracted from a page ship with a co-located `*.test.ts`. Component/hook tests use `*.test.tsx` in the jsdom project.
